  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_01",
      "hash": "dc2609978ca2bbbb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好～！\\n未來的冠軍！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_02",
      "hash": "dc260a978ca2bd6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯葉市的道館就在\\n前面這個方向！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_05",
      "hash": "dc260d978ca2c287",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要前往枯葉道館，\\n就必須要[VAR COLOR(0006)]砍樹[VAR COLOR(0000)]哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_06",
      "hash": "dc260e978ca2c43a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不知道怎麼砍樹？\\c\\n嗯，我記得……\\n聖特安努號的船長\\r\\n應該很熟悉砍樹的方法……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_03",
      "hash": "dc260b978ca2bf21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯葉市的道館就在\\n前面這個方向！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_07",
      "hash": "dc260f978ca2c5ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要前往枯葉道館，\\n就必須要[VAR COLOR(0006)]砍樹[VAR COLOR(0000)]哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_08",
      "hash": "dc2600978ca2ac70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過……\\n現在的[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳和[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\r\\n應該可以輕鬆做到吧！\\r\\n……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳趕快試試看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_04",
      "hash": "dc260c978ca2c0d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "漂亮！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳順利[VAR COLOR(0006)]砍倒了樹[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n開拓出通往道館的路了呢！[VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]\\c\\n很好！這同時也讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n擁有了挑戰道館的資格！\\r\\n我在那裡等著[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    }
  ],
